Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.32,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(325,15)}Sweet Home with Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.32,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs31\pos(298.667,444.334)}Brought to you by: Ko-Fi.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.32,0:00:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0} is doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.69,0:00:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, I needed a scarf like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.83,0:00:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to lend it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.27,0:00:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.14,0:00:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to you so suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't we confirmed that I'll marry Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0} using the Time Machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.62,0:00:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we did. But what's wrong now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.22,0:00:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let Dekisugi flirt with Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.26,0:00:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Dekisugi asked for her scarf...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.63,0:00:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're jealous of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.43,0:00:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet Home!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,if you bring a girl you have crush on...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.85,0:01:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,she'll start loving you after entering the home..
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.09,0:01:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But keep in mind, that it only works as long as both of you are inside the home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.76,0:01:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give it a try!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This home is so spacious!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.43,0:01:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It even has a bathroom and kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.43,0:01:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Switch on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.14,0:01:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.51,0:01:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.91,0:01:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in love with Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.05,0:01:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, you're so gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.92,0:01:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.97,0:02:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,DIsgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.04,0:02:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,After entering the house the second person to enter...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.81,0:02:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,will fall in love with the first person to enter the home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.64,0:02:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.65,0:02:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,i'll go invite Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.55,0:02:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.35,0:02:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm currently doing my homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.86,0:02:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it slowly together, in our sweet home!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.22,0:02:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet Home?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.16,0:02:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But with you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.70,0:02:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What a nice home!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.20,0:02:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've built it for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.30,0:02:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.07,0:02:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.30,0:02:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm coming in!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.30,0:02:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,In this house, the order of entering the house is very important, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.85,0:02:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.42,0:02:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Congragulations, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.39,0:02:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.20,0:03:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.07,0:03:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart is so pounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.87,0:03:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.86,0:03:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.07,0:03:43.30,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\c&H67B374&\frz354.7\pos(386.666,15.001)}I did it~!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.40,0:03:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0} don't you feel the pounding of my heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.61,0:03:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really. Don't you love Dekisugi more than me, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.12,0:03:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave him your scarf after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.88,0:03:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.05,0:04:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a return of a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He always helps me do my homework after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.62,0:04:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the only boy I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.37,0:04:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So please cheer up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.24,0:04:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How spacious!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the bathroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.88,0:04:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful! I've always wanted to take bath in a bathroom like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.78,0:04:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.22,0:04:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need my help anymore, so I'm going home!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.73,0:04:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's rest.  I love kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.26,0:04:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.36,0:04:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When I see that shape, it reminds me of butt ...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.31,0:05:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bake hotcake just for you, in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to hear that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.15,0:05:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait a minute...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.25,0:05:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring the ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.25,0:05:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.26,0:05:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Giko-{\i1}chan{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.43,0:05:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.43,0:05:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to model the protagonist of my new gag Manga after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.07,0:05:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How nice it'd be to taste the hotcake baked by Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.15,0:05:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she's home?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.65,0:05:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you sure took so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.06,0:05:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.46,0:05:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.14,0:06:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Giko, get back to your senses!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.59,0:06:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what was I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, where is Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.07,0:06:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,oh, Giko!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bro, I have a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.41,0:06:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You wanted to model character after him, but he ran away?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.48,0:06:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, Big Bro will catch him for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.22,0:06:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Count me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.69,0:06:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please ocme back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.92,0:06:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I feel weird inside there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.59,0:06:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to take bath in that bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.50,0:07:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have to finish my homeowrk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.27,0:07:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you join me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.91,0:07:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've to water the plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.21,0:07:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.98,0:07:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that small home?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.80,0:07:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo, you're so manly and handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.74,0:07:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant, why did your face suddenly changed like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.68,0:07:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.51,0:07:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.42,0:07:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo, do you love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.75,0:07:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant, come back to your senses!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't! Please say "I love you" to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.97,0:08:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Suneo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ok, Giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.52,0:08:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, how dare you run from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.16,0:08:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0} is up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.79,0:08:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
